Description: SDIO on the RG353V internal wireless slot
 Add the RK3566 SDIO host to the build and match it before the storage
 host. The new host accepts only the RG353V internal wireless slot.
Author: The Blueberry Pie OS Authors
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-24
--- a/xnu/iokit/KernelConfigTables.cpp
+++ b/xnu/iokit/KernelConfigTables.cpp
@@ -30,6 +30,7 @@
